  "notes": "キモい is a slang i-adjective meaning gross, disgusting, or creepy.\n\nETYMOLOGY:\nAbbreviation of ⟦{気持|きも}ち{悪|わる}い→気持ち悪い：07154_kimochiwarui⟧ (unpleasant, disgusting).\n\nFORMS:\n- Negative: キモくない\n- Past: キモかった\n- Adverbial: キモく\n- Te-form: キモくて\n\nUSAGE:\n- Common among younger speakers\n- Can describe things, situations, or people\n- Considered rude when directed at people\n- Usually written in katakana\n\nSIMILAR SLANG:\n- ⟦ウザい→ウザい：04750_uzai⟧: annoying\n- ⟦ダサい→ダサい：04752_dasai⟧: uncool, lame\n- ⟦やばい→やばい：04747_yabai⟧: crazy, awesome/terrible\n\nNote: ⟦{気持|きも}ち{悪|わる}い→気持ち悪い：07154_kimochiwarui⟧ is the standard, less casual form.",
